## When Modifying ROSE Code

1. Follow existing code patterns in src/
2. Add corresponding tests in tests/
3. Update documentation in docs/
4. Run `make check` before committing
5. Use SPDX license headers (BSD license)

## ROSE-Specific Patterns

### AST Traversal
```cpp
class MyTraversal : public AstSimpleProcessing {
public:
    void visit(SgNode* node) override;
};
```

### Node Type Checking
```cpp
if (SgFunctionDeclaration* funcDecl = isSgFunctionDeclaration(node)) {
    // Process function declaration
}
```

### Building AST Nodes
```cpp
SgExprStatement* stmt = SageBuilder::buildExprStatement(expr);
SageInterface::appendStatement(stmt, scope);
```

